        "fields": {
          "notes": "Ancient composition identified through the modern labels used by ETCSL and CDLI, with ancient wording transmitted through incipit and manuscript tradition. ETCSL 5.6.1 and CDLI Q000782/P478969 provide modern representations; the two recorded Early Dynastic tablets provide physical witnesses, and Alster 1974 supplies a scholarly edition."
